  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[node-sass](https://www.npmjs.com/package/node-sass) just published its new version 3.11.2.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      node-sass\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      3.11.2\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs node-sass is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n[GitHub Release](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/releases/tag/v3.11.2)\n\n<h2>Fixes</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Regressions in handling proxies (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/xzyfer\" class=\"user-mention\">@xzyfer</a>, <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sass/node-sass/issues/1785\" class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sass/node-sass/issues/1785\" data-id=\"187191379\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load issue title\" data-permission-text=\"Issue title is private\">#1785</a>, <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sass/node-sass/issues/1787\" class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sass/node-sass/issues/1787\" data-id=\"187280829\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load issue title\" data-permission-text=\"Issue title is private\">#1787</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h4>Supported Environments</h4>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>OS</th>\n<th>Architecture</th>\n<th>Node</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>x86 &amp; x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6,7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSX</td>\n<td>x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>x86 &amp; x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FreeBSD</td>\n<td>i386 &amp; amd64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>*Linux support refers to Ubuntu, Debian, and CentOS 5</p>\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 21 commits .\n\n- [`7fe625c`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/7fe625c6e860e0fcac7643703c3ec14258df02e6) <code>3.11.2</code>\n- [`2acdcf0`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/2acdcf008fd4d5b37402c32878cf5500b1564ca3) <code>Merge pull request #1789 from sass/fix/download-proxy-opts</code>\n- [`3072444`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/307244488734d03d6bcd859b0aa205ff7f6541f3) <code>Fix proxy config for binary download</code>\n- [`b357146`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/b357146ef8dc4c6c6d8de77c0717802eb711c38d) <code>Merge pull request #1784 from anaibol/patch-1</code>\n- [`69f263f`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/69f263f0dcec7079a39e275d9ddbf1fdbb34dbc4) <code>Update supported node versions</code>\n- [`36856f4`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/36856f4102d6a3b382b14f86d98a56d3c033307e) <code>3.11.1</code>\n- [`5759276`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/5759276eb63cf79b4a39001cad340fb39fe48732) <code>Revert \"Install: Use a cache folder for binary download\"</code>\n- [`73726fe`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/73726fe7b28b8dfc82f3e03591fa3488348abae3) <code>3.11.0</code>\n- [`cb328e3`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/cb328e325de6c914432770b3eaaa44af6bca88b7) <code>Merge pull request #1753 from NicolaiSoeborg/patch-1</code>\n- [`4116c38`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/4116c389a5840fbcc7f107c3eeab6aec0a938ba5) <code>Merge pull request #1725 from xzyfer/fix/no-proxy</code>\n- [`5dba770`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/5dba770e05ea37fb833091b8f6d560a8683db9ae) <code>Factor our proxy resolution for testability</code>\n- [`3a4e9c6`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/3a4e9c6c69a0571e20a9ae48885ad23c29200109) <code>Respect NO_PROXY when downloading the binary</code>\n- [`bd6d7a3`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/bd6d7a35cb5791a33cbda0051c6d80ddffd6f0f8) <code>Add Node 7 as a supported environment</code>\n- [`d27ff73`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/d27ff73fe5bed54ce28023b87aa6bc5c30f233a0) <code>Fix links in troubleshooting.md</code>\n- [`360a430`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/360a4308bac15219782fa6f7fe4f46df8d53929e) <code>Merge pull request #1744 from pselden/patch-1</code>\n\n\nThere are 21 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/compare/7e27148d834dc2b092f4882895a0b18e70c4bbea...7fe625c6e860e0fcac7643703c3ec14258df02e6).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
